(COMMERCIAL REAL ESTATE SUBLEASE AGREEMENT) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(This Sublease Agreement is entered into as of February 1, 2026 by and between) Tj
T*
(Metro Real Estate Holdings LLC \('Sublessor'\) and Nexa Innovations Corp \('Subtenant'\).) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(RECITALS) Tj
T*
(WHEREAS, Sublessor is the tenant under a prime lease dated January 15, 2024 with 500 Market Landlord LP;) Tj
T*
(WHEREAS, Subtenant desires to sublease a portion of the building described herein.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(ARTICLE 1: DEMISED PREMISES AND TERM) Tj
T*
(1.1 Demised Premises: Sublessor leases to Subtenant Suite 400 located at 500 Market Street, San Francisco, CA.) Tj
T*
(1.2 Term: The initial term commences on March 1, 2026 and terminates promptly on February 28, 2029.) Tj
T*
(1.3 Early Access: Subtenant shall have access five \(5\) business days prior to commencement solely for staging.) Tj
T*
ET
endstream
endobj
