(ARTICLE 2: RENT AND SECURITY DEPOSIT) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(2.1 Monthly Base Rent: Subtenant agrees to pay base monthly rent of $8,500 USD on the first day of each calendar month.) Tj
T*
(Rent payments shall be made electronically to Sublessor's designated account.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(2.2 Security Deposit: A refundable Security Deposit of $17,000 USD is due upon signing.) Tj
T*
(The deposit shall be held in an interest-bearing escrow account as security for the faithful performance of all covenants.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(2.3 Late Charges: If rent is received after the 5th, a late surcharge of $450 USD will be charged.) Tj
T*
(Said surcharge constitutes agreed administrative damages and not a forfeiture.) Tj
T*
ET
endstream
endobj
