(ARTICLE 3: USE OF PREMISES AND PERMITTED OPERATIONS) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(3.1 Permitted Use: The Demised Premises shall be used exclusively for general executive office purposes) Tj
T*
(and software engineering development, in full compliance with all municipal and state codes.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(ARTICLE 4: ALTERATIONS, FIXTURES AND IMPROVEMENTS) Tj
T*
(4.1 Improvements: Subtenant must obtain prior written approval before installing any structural fixtures.) Tj
T*
(All non-structural cosmetic painting or cabling may proceed upon ten \(10\) days advance notice to Sublessor.) Tj
T*
(4.2 Mechanics Liens: Subtenant shall promptly discharge any mechanic's lien within fifteen \(15\) days of filing.) Tj
T*
ET
endstream
endobj
