(ARTICLE 5: MAINTENANCE AND UTILITIES) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(5.1 Sublessor Maintenance: Sublessor shall maintain the building structural elements, common corridors, and elevators.) Tj
T*
(5.2 Subtenant Maintenance: Subtenant shall maintain the interior premises in neat and sanitary condition.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(ARTICLE 6: INSURANCE REQUIREMENTS) Tj
T*
(6.1 Liability Coverage: Subtenant shall maintain commercial general liability insurance of not less than $2,000,000 USD aggregate.) Tj
T*
(6.2 Certificate of Insurance: Subtenant shall deliver a certificate naming Sublessor and Prime Landlord as additional insureds.) Tj
T*
ET
endstream
