(ARTICLE 7: ASSIGNMENT AND SUBLETTING) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(7.1 Consent Required: Subtenant shall not assign or further sublet the Demised Premises without Sublessor's written consent.) Tj
T*
(Sublessor shall not unreasonably withhold, condition, or delay its consent for creditworthy corporate successors.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(ARTICLE 8: CASUALTY AND RESTORATION) Tj
T*
(8.1 Fire and Casualty: In the event of substantial damage rendering the premises unusable for sixty \(60\) days,) Tj
T*
(either party may terminate this Sublease upon twenty \(20\) days notice.) Tj
T*
ET
endstream
endobj
