(ARTICLE 9: DEFAULT AND REMEDIES) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(9.1 Events of Default: Failure to pay rent within five \(5\) days of written notice shall constitute an event of default.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(ARTICLE 10: MUNICIPAL ACTIONS AND REPOSSESSION RIGHTS) Tj
T*
(10.1 Special Repossession: Section 14: Sublessor reserves unconditional right to repossess premises upon 7 days notice in the event of municipal zoning revisions without refunding unamortized improvements. Subtenant waives all jury trial rights.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(ARTICLE 11: SURRENDER OF PREMISES) Tj
T*
(11.1 Surrender: Upon expiration or earlier termination, Subtenant shall vacate and yield the Demised Premises broom clean.) Tj
T*
ET
endstream
