(ARTICLE 12: GENERAL PROVISIONS) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(12.1 Governing Law: This Agreement shall be governed by the laws of the State of California, without regard to conflicts.) Tj
T*
(12.2 Notices: All formal notices shall be sent via certified mail or nationally recognized courier.) Tj
T*
(12.3 Entire Agreement: This Sublease constitutes the entire agreement between the parties.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(EXHIBIT A: DEMISED PREMISES FLOOR PLAN AND SPECIFICATIONS) Tj
T*
(Suite 400 comprises approximately 4,200 rentable square feet located on the fourth floor of 500 Market Street.) Tj
T*
(The space includes six private perimeter offices, two conference rooms, an open collaboration area, and kitchen.) Tj
